<title>UK: Glaxo Wellcome H1 profits, sales lower.</title>
<headline>Glaxo Wellcome H1 profits, sales lower.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>(billion stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		29.4		   vs 29.7</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 15.0		   vs 15.0</p>
<p> Pretax		     1.517		  vs 1.551</p>
<p> Turnover		   4.109		  vs 4.189</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 1.475 and 1.550 billion stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - Glaxo Wellcome Plc.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
